X('dap-delivered-at-place-incoterm',[('Quick checklist before you quote DAP',['Get the exact delivery address and ask whether a vehicle can reach it.','Quote the freight to that address, and keep a margin for waiting time and delays.','State in the contract that the buyer pays import duty, taxes and the unloading.','Keep proof of delivery, since it shows when the risk passed to the buyer.','Check the insurance covers the whole route to the named place.'])])
X('exporting-to-saudi-arabia-saber',[('Quick checklist before you ship',['Ask the buyer for the regulation and certificate that apply to your product code.','Collect test reports and factory details early, since the certificate depends on them.','Check the invoice, packing list and certificate agree on names, codes and quantities.','Confirm Arabic labelling or marking rules for consumer products.','Keep a copy of the shipment certificate with the shipping documents.'])])
X('exw-ex-works-incoterm',[('Quick checklist before you agree EXW',['Confirm who will load the goods, and whether your staff and equipment are able to do it.','Ask the buyer how the goods will be cleared for export, and by whom.','Keep proof that the goods left India, since it supports your GST and export benefits.','Agree a collection date and what happens if the buyer\'s truck is late.','Consider FCA instead, if you want to keep control of the export clearance.'])])
X('proforma-invoice-vs-commercial-invoice',[('Quick checklist',['Mark the proforma as a proforma, with a validity date.','Use the same item descriptions and prices on the commercial invoice, unless something changed.','Do not use the proforma for customs clearance.','Show the Incoterm and the place on both documents.','Keep both with the order, since banks and customs may ask to see the link between them.'])])
X('fob-incoterm-explained',[('Quick checklist for an FOB sale',['Name the port after the term, for example FOB Mundra.','Agree who books the vessel and who is told the sailing dates.','Confirm who pays the terminal handling charges at the origin port.','Deliver the cargo before the gate-in cut-off the buyer\'s forwarder gives you.','Keep the on-board bill of lading and the shipping bill for your records.'])])
X('un-numbers-and-proper-shipping-names',[('Quick checklist',['Take the UN number and name from the current code, and compare with the safety data sheet.','Add the technical name for generic entries.','Write the same details on the declaration, the packages and the booking.','Check again if the formulation changes.','Ask your forwarder to review the details before the cut-off.'])])
X('wood-packaging-ispm-15',[('Quick checklist',['Buy pallets and crates from a supplier that marks them to the standard, and keep the invoice.','Check that the mark is clear and on two sides.','Check the wood is free of bark, insect holes and damage.','Use plastic, metal or processed wood if you cannot get compliant wood in time.','Ask the buyer whether the destination has extra rules for wood packaging.'])])
X('packing-list-guide',[('Quick checklist',['Number each package and match the numbers to the marks on the cartons.','Show gross weight, net weight and dimensions for each package.','Make sure the totals agree with the invoice and the booking.','Repeat the invoice number and date.','Check the list against the goods at the time of loading.'])])
X('safeguard-and-countervailing-duty',[('Quick checklist for an importer',['Search the notifications by product description and HS code before you order.','Ask the supplier for its country of origin and the producer\'s name.','Look at the end date and any review that is under way.','Add a clause to the contract to share the risk of a new duty.','Ask your broker to confirm the duty on the day you plan to file the bill.'])])
X('exporting-to-brazil-from-india',[('Quick checklist before the first order',['Confirm the buyer\'s registration and the licence for your product.','Work out the landed cost with all the Brazilian taxes before you quote.','Ask whether invoices or labels need Portuguese text.','Choose a forwarder with a partner at the Brazilian port.','Allow extra time for clearance on the first shipment.'])])
X('safety-data-sheet-sds-explained',[('Quick checklist',['Check the date and the version of the sheet.','Compare section 14 with the current transport code.','Make sure the sheet covers the exact product you ship.','Give your forwarder the sheet when you ask for the quote.','Keep a copy with the shipment file.'])])
X('exporting-to-the-united-kingdom',[('Quick checklist before you ship',['Ask the buyer for its EORI number and its customs agent\'s details.','Confirm the commodity code and the duty rate with the buyer\'s broker.','Check the product marking rules, such as UKCA or CE.','Prepare the origin certificate if a preference is claimed.','Agree who pays duty and VAT in the contract.'])])
X('ddp-delivered-duty-paid-incoterm',[('Quick checklist before you quote DDP',['Get a duty and tax quote from a local broker, in writing.','Check that a foreign seller may act as importer in the destination.','Add a margin for rate changes and for storage if clearance is slow.','Keep the import documents, since you may need them for tax purposes.','If the risk is too high, quote DAP instead.'])])
X('dedicated-freight-corridor-containers',[('Quick checklist',['Ask which rail terminal and which route will be used.','Compare transit time and cost with road for your lane.','Check cut-offs at the rail terminal, which are often earlier.','Ask about free days and charges at both terminals.','Keep a road option ready in case a train is delayed.'])])
X('exporting-to-australia-biosecurity',[('Quick checklist',['Ask the buyer to check the import conditions for your product on the government system.','Get any permit and certificate before the goods ship.','Inspect the container for dirt, seeds and insects before loading.','Use pallets that meet the wood packaging standard.','Keep photographs of the empty and the loaded container.'])])
X('indian-ports-overview',[('Quick checklist',['List the ports that are within reasonable distance of your factory.','Ask your forwarder for the sailings to your destination from each.','Compare the total cost, including the inland movement and the port charges.','Check the average time that containers spend at the port.','Keep a second port in mind, in case of congestion or a strike.'])])
X('trade-finance-options-for-exporters',[('Quick checklist',['Ask your bank which products it offers and the cost of each.','Prepare your financial statements and your orders before you apply.','Compare the interest rate, fees and any collateral required.','Check whether credit insurance improves the terms.','Make sure the repayment date matches the buyer\'s payment date.'])])
X('social-welfare-surcharge-explained',[('Quick checklist',['Check the surcharge on every duty line of the bill of entry.','Include it in the landed cost, before IGST.','Look for any notification that exempts it for your goods.','Update the figure when the rate or the basic duty changes.','Use the duty calculator to see each head on one page.'])])
X('vgm-verified-gross-mass-guide',[('Quick checklist',['Check the VGM cut-off with your forwarder, in writing.','Use a weighbridge with a valid calibration certificate.','Include the pallets, packing and dunnage in the weight.','Send the declaration with the right container number.','Keep the weighbridge slip, since the line may ask to see it.'])])
X('cbm-calculation-guide',[('Quick checklist',['Measure the outside dimensions of the packed carton.','Use the same unit for all three measurements.','Add the pallet if the cargo ships on one.','Compare the volume with the weight before you request a quote.','Use the container load planner when the fit matters.'])])
X('perishable-cargo-by-air-and-sea',[('Quick checklist',['Get the temperature and handling instructions from the buyer or the producer.','Pre-cool the goods and the container or the packaging.','Book a confirmed flight or sailing and a cold store at the port.','Put a temperature logger in the cargo.','Get the phytosanitary or health certificates in time.'])])
X('un-locode-and-customs-port-codes-india',[('Quick checklist',['Use the customs location code on every customs filing.','Use the UN/LOCODE on bookings and tracking requests.','Check the spelling of the place name against the code.','Ask your broker if a code does not look right.','Look up the code again if the customs office changes.'])])
X('delivery-order-explained',[('Quick checklist',['Ask the line what it needs to issue the delivery order.','Check the consignee name against the bill of lading.','Pay the line charges on the day of arrival.','Note the free days on the container.','Keep the delivery order with the customs out of charge for the terminal.'])])
X('how-lcl-consolidation-works',[('Quick checklist',['Compare the LCL quote with a full container quote, including the destination charges.','Pack cargo in strong cartons or on pallets.','Check the CFS cut-off, which is earlier than for a container.','Mark every package with the consignee and the shipping marks.','Allow extra days for the consolidation and the sorting at the destination.'])])
X('rcmc-registration-export-promotion-council',[('Quick checklist',['Pick the council that matches your main product.','Keep your IEC, GST and PAN papers ready to apply.','Note the expiry date and renew before it.','Update the certificate if you add new products.','Quote the RCMC number on the applications that ask for it.'])])
X('cpt-and-cip-incoterms',[('Quick checklist',['Name the destination place, and not just the country.','Confirm where the risk passes, which is at the first carrier.','For CIP, ask for the insurance certificate and check the cover.','Agree who pays the unloading and the local charges.','Use CFR or CIF only for sea shipments.'])])
X('fumigation-certificate-for-exports',[('Quick checklist',['Ask the buyer if fumigation is required, and by which method.','Book an approved fumigator before the cut-off.','Allow time for the gas to be released from the container.','Make sure the certificate shows the container number and the date.','Attach the certificate to the export documents.'])])
X('pharma-cargo-shipping-guide',[('Quick checklist',['Get the temperature range from the product registration.','Pick packaging that suits the whole transit time, with some margin.','Use a data logger and ask for the data after delivery.','Arrange the licences and permits before the cargo moves.','Share the contacts and the plan with the consignee.'])])
X('fca-free-carrier-incoterm',[('Quick checklist for an FCA sale',['Name the exact place of delivery.','Confirm who loads and who unloads at that place.','Clear the goods for export before the handover.','Ask whether the buyer wants the on-board bill of lading option.','Keep the handover receipt, since it shows when the risk passed.'])])
X('cif-incoterm-explained',[('Quick checklist for a CIF sale',['Name the destination port.','Buy insurance for at least the minimum cover, and more if the buyer asks.','Send the buyer the insurance certificate with the other documents.','Remember that the risk passes at loading.','Check the freight cost against your forwarder\'s quote before you fix the price.'])])
X('air-cargo-uld-and-pallets-explained',[('Quick checklist',['Give the dimensions and weight of every piece.','Ask the airline about the aircraft type on your route.','Build the pallet or container to the airline\'s limits.','Check if the cargo needs a freighter.','Ask about the cut-off for building and handing in the pallet.'])])
X('ecgc-export-credit-insurance',[('Quick checklist',['Check the buyer\'s limit before you ship.','Report the shipments and the overdue payments within the policy time.','Keep the contract, invoices and proof of delivery.','Ask what percentage of the loss is covered.','Tell the insurer at once if the buyer\'s position changes.'])])
X('cargo-insurance-guide',[('Quick checklist',['Insure for the CIF value plus a margin.','Choose Clause A for general cargo, unless the policy suits a cheaper cover.','Check the policy for exclusions that apply to your goods.','Keep the survey report and the notice to the carrier after a loss.','Report a claim as soon as the damage is found.'])])
X('exporting-to-the-european-union',[('Quick checklist',['Ask the buyer for its EORI number.','Confirm the tariff code, duty and VAT with the buyer\'s broker.','Check the product rules, such as CE marking and chemicals registration.','Get the health or phytosanitary certificate for food and plants.','Check the labels and the packaging rules in the destination country.'])])
X('lithium-battery-shipping-guide',[('Quick checklist',['Find the UN number for your battery type and check the watt-hour or lithium content.','Ask for the UN test summary from the manufacturer.','Protect the terminals and pack the batteries so they cannot move.','Use the right marks and labels, and the declaration where needed.','Check the airline or line for extra limits before you book.'])])
X('project-cargo-and-break-bulk-guide',[('Quick checklist',['Collect the dimensions, weight and lifting points of each piece.','Plan the route and get the permits early.','Check the cranes and the quay at both ports.','Agree the lashing plan and who pays the surveyor.','Insure the cargo for its full value.'])])
X('open-top-flat-rack-out-of-gauge-cargo',[('Quick checklist',['Send the line the exact dimensions and the weight before booking.','Wait for the written approval before you move the cargo.','Arrange lashing and a surveyor for valuable pieces.','Check the road route and permits to the port.','Allow extra time for the confirmation and the loading.'])])
X('sea-waybill-vs-bill-of-lading',[('Quick checklist',['Check what the contract or the letter of credit requires.','Decide how much you trust the buyer before choosing a waybill.','Ask the line about any fees for either document.','Name the consignee correctly, since a waybill gives the goods to that party only.','Keep the original bills safe if you choose a bill of lading.'])])
